OL,3,GNEWSAMother's heartbreak over son's
OL,4,Aprison cell murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man who was killed by
OL,7,Fhis cellmate at a Shropshire prison
OL,8,Fwalks past her son's untouched bedroom
OL,9,Feach night before crying herself to
OL,10,Fsleep, a court has heard.
OL,12,FJonathan Alcide, 36, was found guilty
OL,13,Fof murdering 49-year-old Neil Ashby at
OL,14,FHMP Stoke Heath in July 2025 at a trial
OL,15,Fin September, and sentenced at Stafford
OL,16,FCrown Court on Tuesday.
OL,18,FIn a statement, Ashby's brother said
OL,19,Fhis mother also walked her deceased
OL,20,Fson's dog and "imagines seeing his
OL,21,Fsmiling face".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
