OL,3,GNEWSAMother's heartbreak over son's
OL,4,Aprison cell murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlcide, who decided to represent
OL,7,Fhimself at the sentencing hearing,
OL,8,Faccepted responsibility for Ashby's
OL,9,Fdeath, and was sentenced to life in
OL,10,Fprison with a minimum term of 15 years
OL,11,Fand five months.
